' Escape and the menu by keys (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 30`).
' On the world map in mouse mode Escape opens the mouse's menu at the middle
' and Escape closes it. An arrow is the keyboard: now Escape opens the shorter
' menu (`ShowContextMenu`), Down lights STATISTICS and Space runs it. In
' Paradise Camp: Escape, the place's key menu; Down, Down lights INFO; Space
' runs it. Into the tent, and Escape closes the room.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
press escape             ' the mouse's menu
press escape             ' closed
press down               ' the keyboard
press escape             ' the key menu
press down               ' STATISTICS
press space              ' run
wait 5
sceneclick 100,100       ' close the statistics
wait 5
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
press down               ' the keyboard again (the click was the mouse)
press escape             ' the place's key menu
press down
press down               ' INFO
press space
wait 5
sceneclick 20,185        ' back
wait 5
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent
wait 200
press escape            ' out of the room
wait 10
quit
